[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ## Human-AI Collaboration Guidelines
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] This project leverages AI-driven development with human oversight. Follow these practices:
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ### Development Workflow
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 1. **Issue Creation** - Humans create issues with clear requirements
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 2. **AI Processing** - Hive Mind analyzes and proposes solutions
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 3. **Human Review** - Code review and architectural decisions
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 4. **Iterative Refinement** - Collaborative improvement cycles
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ### Code Standards
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **TypeScript/JavaScript**: Strict typing required
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **File Size**: Maximum 1000 lines per file
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **Testing**: 100% test coverage for critical paths
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **Documentation**: Machine-readable, token-efficient
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ### Version Management with Changesets
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] This project uses [Changesets](https://github.com/changesets/changesets) to manage versions and changelogs. This eliminates merge conflicts that occur when multiple PRs bump the version in package.json.
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] #### Adding a Changeset
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] When you make changes that affect users, add a changeset:
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ```bash
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] npm run changeset
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] ```
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] This will prompt you to:
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 1. Select the type of change (patch/minor/major)
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 2. Provide a summary of the changes
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] The changeset will be saved as a markdown file in `.changeset/` and should be committed with your PR.
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] #### Changeset Guidelines
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **Patch**: Bug fixes, documentation updates, internal refactoring
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **Minor**: New features, non-breaking enhancements
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] - **Major**: Breaking changes that affect the public API
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] Example changeset summary:
[2026-04-15T18:56:39.128Z] [INFO] 
