rkflow as requested.\\\\n\\\\n### Changes Made\\\\n\\\\n1. **Created `.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml`** - A unified CI/CD workflow that:\\\\n   - Runs tests on all three platforms (Node.js, Bun, Deno) for every push to main and every PR\\\\n   - Only attempts to publish on pushes to the main branch\\\\n   - Checks if the current version already exists on NPM before publishing\\\\n   - Only publishes if all tests pass AND the version is not yet published\\\\n\\\\n2. **Removed old workflows**:\\\\n   - Deleted `.github/workflows/test.yml`\\\\n   - Deleted `.github/workflows/publish.yml`\\\\n\\\\n### How It Works\\\\n\\\\n- On PRs: All tests run in parallel (as you can see in the checks above)\\\\n- On pushes to main: All tests run, and if they all pass, the publish job checks NPM\\\\n  - If the current package version (0.1.1) is not published → publishes to NPM\\\\n  - If the version already exists → skips publishing with a message\\\\n\\\\n### CI Status\\\\n\\\\n✅ All tests passing:\\\\n- Test on Node.js: ✅ Pass (6s)\\\\n- Test on Bun: ✅ Pass (7s)\\\\n- Test on Deno: ✅ Pass (7s)\\\\n- Publish to NPM: ⏭️ Skipping (as expected on PR)\\\\n\\\\nThe PR is now ready for review and merge.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\\\nEOF\\\\n)\\\\\\\"\\\",\\ndocs/case-studies/pr-4-revert-issue/session2_log.txt:2493:        \\\"content\\\": \\\"https://github.com/link-foundation/test-anywhere/pull/4#issuecomment-3406796950\\\",\\ndocs/case-studies/pr-4-revert-issue/session2_log.txt:2546:          \\\"command\\\": \\\"gh pr view 4 --repo link-foundation/test-anywhere --json url,title,state,isDraft,mergeable --jq '{url, title, state, isDraft, mergeable}'\\\",\\ndocs/case-studies/pr-4-revert-issue/session2_log.txt:2577:        \\\"content\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"isDraft\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"mergeable\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"MERGEABLE\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"state\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"OPEN\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Add CD workflow to publish to NPM when all 