[2026-04-15T18:59:36.467Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented the fix on `issue-1614-2fe968881d10` and pushed it to PR 1615: https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/1615\n\nThe root cause was in [`src/solve.validation.lib.mjs`](/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776279295749/src/solve.validation.lib.mjs): the auto-resume parser only accepted time-only strings, so `Apr 17, 4:00 AM` threw `Invalid time format`. I updated it to strip an optional month/day prefix before parsing, and added a regression test in [`tests/test-solve-validation-reset-time.mjs`](/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1776279295749/tests/test-solve-validation-reset-time.mjs) covering both `parseResetTime` and `calculateWaitTime`.\n\nVerified locally with `node tests/test-solve-validation-reset-time.mjs` and `npm run test:usage-limit`. Working tree is clean, and the PR title/description now reflect the actual fix, reproduction, and verification."}}
